{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27894","headline":"送韩校书赴江西幕 · 朱庆余","name":"送韩校书赴江西幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从军五湖外，终是称诗人。\n酒後愁将别，涂中过却春。\n山桥槲叶暗，水馆燕巢新。\n驿舫迎应远，京书寄自频。\n野情随到处，公务日关身。\n久共趋名利，龙锺独滞秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}